			"notes": "- Every mod's page in the mod menu has Play demo, where the mod ships one.\n- Spies: standing up from a seat no longer leaves an armour stand behind every time.\n- Big arenas don't stall the server when they start, drop their walls, count a takeover or lay a saved terrain.\n- Waves sent early stop at 150 mobs standing, and the trap list forgets blocks that are gone.\n- The scoreboard, the weather and endless blocks send only what changed.\n- An arena's mobs and golems get their goals once, and smaller per-tick costs trimmed.\n- An arena's game state goes with the server when it stops, not into the next world opened.\n- Spies: a seat brought back with a player who logged out sitting is taken away when they stand.\n- A takeover goal that comes back mid-count starts its count afresh, and a wave held for its players still stops at 150 standing."
		},
