			"notes": "- Mod demos: each mod with one has a short level to play that shows what it does. New players are asked once if they'd like to try them, and everyone is asked when a new one arrives.\n- /pvp demos lists them, ticked once played. Play them in any order, straight from one to the next; your own things wait at home until you're done.\n- With Spawn Lock, nobody held at the spawn goes into an arena or a demo, and someone jailed from inside an arena is let out where they were before it.\n- Arenas can't be joined from Minicraft's workshop: step back out to the bench first, so your own things stay with you."
		},
